{"verses":[{"id":5189,"verse_number":1,"verse_key":"63:1","juz_number":28,"rub_el_hizb_number":221,"hizb_number":56,"ruku_number":490,"manzil_number":7,"sajdah_number":null,"page_number":554,"text_uthmani":" إِذَا جَآءَكَ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ قَالُوا۟ نَشْهَدُ إِنَّكَ لَرَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ إِنَّكَ لَرَسُولُهُۥ وَٱللَّهُ يَشْهَدُ إِنَّ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","trs":{"20":"When the hypocrites come to you, [O Muḥammad], they say, \"We testify that you are the Messenger of Allāh.\" And Allāh knows that you are His Messenger, and Allāh testifies that the hypocrites are liars.","85":"When the hypocrites come to you [Prophet], they say, ‘We bear witness that you are the Messenger of God.’ God knows that you truly are His Messenger and He bears witness that the hypocrites are liars––","22":"When the Hypocrites come to thee, they say, \"We bear witness that thou art indeed the Messenger of Allah.\" Yea, Allah knoweth that thou art indeed His Messenger, and Allah beareth witness that the Hypocrites are indeed liars.","203":"When the hypocrites come to you (O Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم), they say: \"We bear witness that you are indeed the Messenger of Allâh.\" Allâh knows that you are indeed His Messenger, and Allâh bears witness that the hypocrites are liars indeed. <sup foot_note=154981>1</sup>"},"words":[{"id":469,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِذَا","translation":{"text":"When","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"idhā","language_name":"english"}},{"id":470,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"جَآءَكَ","translation":{"text":"come to you","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"jāaka","language_name":"english"}},{"id":471,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ","translation":{"text":"the hypocrites","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-munāfiqūna","language_name":"english"}},{"id":472,"position":4,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","translation":{"text":"they say","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"qālū","language_name":"english"}},{"id":473,"position":5,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نَشْهَدُ","translation":{"text":"We testify","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"nashhadu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":474,"position":6,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","translation":{"text":"that you","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"innaka","language_name":"english"}},{"id":475,"position":7,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَرَسُولُ","translation":{"text":"(are) surely (the) Messenger","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"larasūlu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":476,"position":8,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","translation":{"text":"(of) Allah","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi","language_name":"english"}},{"id":478,"position":9,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","translation":{"text":"And Allah","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"wal-lahu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":479,"position":10,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","translation":{"text":"knows","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"yaʿlamu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":480,"position":11,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","translation":{"text":"that you","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"innaka","language_name":"english"}},{"id":481,"position":12,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَرَسُولُهُۥ","translation":{"text":"(are) surely His Messenger","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"larasūluhu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":482,"position":13,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","translation":{"text":"and Allah","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"wal-lahu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":483,"position":14,"char_type_n