er thou pray for their forgiveness or not. Allah will not forgive them. Truly Allah guides not rebellious transgressors.","203":"It is equal to them whether you (Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم) ask forgiveness or ask not forgiveness for them, Allâh will never forgive them. Verily, Allâh guides not the people who are the Fâsiqîn (rebellious, disobedient to Allâh).<sup foot_note=154983>1</sup>"},"words":[{"id":6353,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"سَوَآءٌ","translation":{"text":"(It) is same","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"sawāon","language_name":"english"}},{"id":6354,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","translation":{"text":"for them","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"ʿalayhim","language_name":"english"}},{"id":6355,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَسْتَغْفَرْتَ","translation":{"text":"whether you ask forgiveness","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"astaghfarta","language_name":"english"}},{"id":6356,"position":4,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","translation":{"text":"for them","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"lahum","language_name":"english"}},{"id":6357,"position":5,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَمْ","translation":{"text":"or","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"am","language_name":"english"}},{"id":6358,"position":6,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَمْ","translation":{"text":"(do) not","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"lam","language_name":"english"}},{"id":6359,"position":7,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"تَسْتَغْفِرْ","translation":{"text":"ask forgiveness","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"tastaghfir","language_name":"english"}},{"id":6360,"position":8,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","translation":{"text":"for them","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"lahum","language_name":"englis