ak,’ but power belongs to God, to His Messenger, and to the believers, though the hypocrites do not know this.","22":"They say, \"If we return to Medina, surely the more honourable (element) will expel therefrom the meaner.\" But honour belongs to Allah and His Messenger, and to the Believers; but the Hypocrites know not.","203":"They (hyprocrites) say: \"If we return to Al-Madinah, indeed the more honourable (‘Abdullâh bin Ubai bin Salûl, the chief of hyprocrites at Al-Madinah) will expel therefrom the meaner (i.e. Allâh’s Messenger صلى الله عليه وسلم).\" But honour, power and glory belong to Allâh, and to His Messenger (Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم), and to the believers, but the hypocrites know not."},"words":[{"id":8940,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","translation":{"text":"They say","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"yaqūlūna","language_name":"english"}},{"id":8941,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَئِن","translation":{"text":"If","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"la-in","language_name":"english"}},{"id":8942,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"رَّجَعْنَآ","translation":{"text":"we return","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"rajaʿnā","language_name":"english"}},{"id":8943,"position":4,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِلَى","translation":{"text":"to","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"ilā","language_name":"english"}},{"id":8944,"position":5,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","translation":{"text":"Al-Madinah","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-madīnati","language_name":"english"}},{"id":8945,"position":6,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَيُخْرِجَنَّ","translation":{"text":"surely, will expel","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"layukh'rijanna","language_name":"english"}},{"id":8946,"position":7,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعَزُّ",